    "bodyFull": "{\"dataBuild\":\"20/03/2026 - 11:57\",\"versao\":\"2.19.1\",\"ambienteTST\":false,\"numeroRegional\":1,\"baseURLPJe\":\"https://pje.trt1.jus.br\",\"textoFaleConosco\":\"<div id=\\\"j_id1117:j_id1118:16:j_id1119\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\"><img style=\\\"width: 50px;\\\" title=\\\"Arraste para o documento\\\" src=\\\"http://pje.trt1.jus.br/primeirograu/img/brasaoRep.png\\\" alt=\\\"\\\" /></div>\\n<div style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: medium;\\\"><strong>PODER JUDICI&Aacute;RIO FEDERAL</strong></span></p>\\n<span style=\\\"font-size: medium;\\\"> </span>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: medium;\\\"><strong>JUSTI&Ccedil;A DO TRABALHO<br /></strong></span></p>\\n<span style=\\\"font-size: medium;\\\"> </span>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: medium;\\\"><strong>TRIBUNAL REGIONAL DO TRABALHO 1&ordf; REGI&Atilde;O</strong></span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: center;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left;\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: x-small;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Prezado(a) Usu&aacute;rio(a):</span></span></strong></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: x-small;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><br /></span></span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: x-small;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>&nbsp;</strong>Abaixo seguem os canais de atendimento para suporte ao sistema PJe:</span></span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"margin: 0cm 0cm 0.0001pt; text-align: left;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n<table class=\\\"MsoNormalTable\\\" style=\\\"background-image: initial; background-position: initial; background-size: initial; background-repeat: initial; background-attachment: initial; background-origin: initial; background-clip: initial; border: 1pt dashed silver;\\\" border=\\\"1\\\" cellspacing=\\\"3\\\" cellpadding=\\\"0\\\">\\n<tbody>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>Canal para   suporte</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>Descri&ccedil;&atilde;o</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; text-align: center; line-height: normal;\\\" align=\\\"center\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>Endere&ccedil;o</strong><strong>&nbsp;</strong></span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Portal/Site&nbsp;</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Formul&aacute;rio para esclarecimento de d&uacute;vidas sobre   utiliza&ccedil;&atilde;o do PJe&nbsp;</span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\\\"><a href=\\\"https://pesquisas.trt1.jus.br/pesquisas/index.php/941152?lang=pt-BR\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Formul&aacute;rio d&uacute;vidas PJe</span></a></span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Atendimento Presencial</span></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Atendimento presencial&nbsp;</span></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Dias e hor&aacute;rios: 2&ordf; a 6&ordf; feira (exceto feriados),   das&nbsp;9 &agrave;s 16 horas.</span></span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>1&ordm; Grau -&nbsp;</strong>Endere&ccedil;os de atendimento:</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>Capital</strong>: Divis&atilde;o de Apoio ao Usu&aacute;rio do PJe (DIAPJ) Rua do Lavradio, 132, 4&ordm;   andar, Lapa - Rio de Janeiro-RJ</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">&nbsp;<strong>Interior</strong>: Varas do Trabalho de   designa&ccedil;&atilde;o do Juiz Diretor dos F&oacute;runs e das Varas &uacute;nicas do Trabalho (<a href=\\\"https://www.trt1.jus.br/web/guest/lista-unidades-de-atendimento-ao-usuario\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Rela&ccedil;&atilde;o de Endere&ccedil;os</a>)</span></span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\"><strong>2&ordm; Grau</strong>&nbsp;-<strong>&nbsp;</strong>Endere&ccedil;o de atendimento:<br /> Divis&atilde;o de Apoio ao Usu&aacute;rio do PJe (DIAPJ) Rua do Lavradio, 132, 4&ordm; andar,   Lapa - Rio de Janeiro-RJ</span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n<tr>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">E-mail</span></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Canal para solu&ccedil;&atilde;o de problemas do PJe</span></span></p>\\n</td>\\n<td style=\\\"border: dashed silver 1.0pt; mso-border-alt: dashed silver .75pt; padding: .75pt .75pt .75pt .75pt;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"MsoNormal\\\" style=\\\"mso-margin-bottom-alt: auto; line-height: normal;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto;\\\"><a href=\\\"mailto:pjeapoio@trt1.jus.br\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">pjeapoio@trt1.jus.br</span></a></span></p>\\n</td>\\n</tr>\\n</tbody>\\n</table>\\n</div>\\n<div id=\\\"j_id1045:j_id1046:21:j_id1047\\\" style=\\\"text-align: center;\\\">\\n<p class=\\\"corpo\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: justify !important; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><strong><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Outros servi&ccedil;os:</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\\"corpo\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: justify !important; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">- Cria&ccedil;&atilde;o de senhas para pessoa f&iacute;sica que seja parte no processo: <a rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https://pesquisas.trt1.jus.br/pesquisas/index.php/475738?lang=pt-BR\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">preencha o formul&aacute;rio aqui</a>.</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"corpo\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: justify !important; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">- D&uacute;vidas e reclama&ccedil;&otilde;es sobre o andamento do processo: <a rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https://proad.trt1.jus.br/portal-proad/pages/public/formularios/ouvidoria.html\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">preencha o formul&aacute;rio aqui</a>.</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"corpo\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: justify !important; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><strong style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">USU&Aacute;RIOS INTERNOS:</span></strong></p>\\n<p class=\\\"corpo\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: justify !important; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">O suporte ser&aacute; prestado mediante abertura de chamado, preferencialmente por e-mail, ou pelo site ou telefone.</span></p>\\n<p class=\\\"corpo\\\" style=\\\"font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5; margin-left: 0 !important; text-align: justify !important; text-indent: 4.5cm;\\\"><span style=\\\"font-size: small;\\\">Para maiores informa&ccedil;&otilde;es, consulte o <a rel=\\\"noopener noreferrer\\\" href=\\\"https://bibliotecadigital.trt1.jus.br/jspui/bitstream/1001/2326037/3/Ato2020-0045-C.htm\\\" target=\\\"_blank\\\">Ato 45/2020</a>,&nbsp;que regulamenta o atendimento ao PJe no TRT 1&ordf; Regi&atilde;o.</span></p>\\n<p style=\\\"text-align: left;\\\">&nbsp;</p>\\n</div>\",\"linkManualUsuario\":\"https://pje.csjt.jus.br/manual/index.php/PJe_2.0_-_Consulta_Processual_Unificada_2.5\",\"urlConsultaProcessualTerceiros\":\"https://pje.trt1.jus.br/consultaprocessual/consulta-terceiros\"}"
